      "content": "The number of dishes each student makes does not change how much clay is needed for **one dish**.\n\nSince each dish requires 2 cups of clay:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{2\\text{ cups}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Actually, that was wrong. Rory makes 20 more clay dishes than Kora.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "The number of dishes each student makes is irrelevant to the amount needed for one dish.\n\nEach clay dish requires **2 cups of clay**, so each student needs:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{2\\text{ cups}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Oh, I forgot to mention: Kora makes 20 clay dishes.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Kora makes 20 dishes, so Rory makes \\(20+20=40\\) dishes, and Jada makes \\(2\\times40=80\\) dishes. However, the amount of clay for **one dish** is still given directly:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{2\\text{ cups}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Great. Now let's take that a step further. How many total clay dishes do Jada and Rory make together?",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Rory makes:\n\n\\[\n20+20=40\\text{ dishes}\n\\]\n\nJada makes twice as many as Rory:\n\n\\[\n2\\times 40=80\\text{ dishes}\n\\]\n\nTogether, they make:\n\n\\[\n80+40=\\boxed{120\\text{ clay dishes}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "I should also tell you: Jada, Rory, and Kora make clay dishes for their school art project.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "That information does not change the calculation. Jada and Rory still make:\n\n\\[\n80+40=\\boxed{120\\text{ clay dishes}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Good, now using that, can you calculate: How many clay dishes do Jada, Rory, and Kora make together?",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Kora makes 20 dishes, and Rory makes 20 more:\n\n\\[\nRory=20+20=40\n\\]\n\nJada makes twice as many as Rory:\n\n\\[\nJada=2(40)=80\n\\]\n\nTogether:\n\n\\[\n80+40+20=\\boxed{140\\text{ clay dishes}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    }
